      <description>&lt;table cellpadding=&quot;0&quot; cellspacing=&quot;0&quot; border=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align: middle; padding-right: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35663410?s=96&amp;amp;v=4&quot; width=&quot;96&quot; height=&quot;96&quot; alt=&quot;@Rangi42&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0; padding: 0; border-radius: 50%;&quot; /&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;td style=&quot;vertical-align: middle;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Rangi42&quot;&gt;Rangi&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #57606a;&quot;&gt;@Rangi42&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&amp;#39;m Rangi! I work on the RGBDS GB assembler with &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/ISSOtm&quot;&gt;@ISSOtm&lt;/a&gt;💙, the Pokémon Gen 1+2 disassemblies for &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/pret&quot;&gt;@pret&lt;/a&gt;, and my own Polished Crystal hack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;367&lt;/strong&gt; followers · &lt;strong&gt;0&lt;/strong&gt; following&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;list-style-type: none; padding-left: 0;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;list-style-type: none; margin-bottom: 4px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/map-pin.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;map-pin&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 8px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;Unova&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Popular Repository&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/Rangi42/polishedcrystal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;polishedcrystal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;https://mshibanami.github.io/GitHubTrendingRSS/assets/icons/star.png&quot; width=&quot;20&quot; height=&quot;20&quot; alt=&quot;star&quot; style=&quot;margin: 0 4px 0 0; padding: 0; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle;&quot; /&gt;1.6k &lt;img src=&quot